3	/****************************************************************************
4	 * SKW6621S WiFi vendor command channel.
5	 *
6	 * Follows the SDK swt6621s_wifi driver (skw_drv_probe):
7	 *   service start -> SYN_VERSION -> GET_INFO -> PHY_BB_CFG (calibration
8	 *   file) -> OPEN_DEV (station, inst 0) -> START_SCAN.
9	 * Every message is a skw_msg header plus parameters on SDIO v2 port 6;
10	 * the CP answers with CMD_ACK (header, u16 status, return data) and
11	 * reports scan results as SCAN_REPORT events.  Commands are sent one at a
12	 * time and each waits (bounded) for its ack.
13	 ****************************************************************************/
